{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Runemancer:Final 21 Days&quot; is a unique rogue-like game. As a runemancer, players can harness the power of stone slabs to traverse between reality and dreams. Influence dreams through rune divination to grow stronger continuously, defeat monsters invading reality within 21 days, and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the one chosen by the &quot;Dream Ouija&quot;, you can traverse between reality and dreams with stone slabs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect orbs on the &quot;Dream Ouija&quot; to form specific circuits, unleashing powerful skills or restricting your opponent's abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/bb3bdc31ea3eed16e3ad13ef5a3875b1.poster.avif?t=1769150515\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/bb3bdc31ea3eed16e3ad13ef5a3875b1.webm?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/bb3bdc31ea3eed16e3ad13ef5a3875b1.mp4?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move you make is critical\u2014carefully decide whether to strengthen yourself or disrupt your foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9761a9c2cb4c17f25d81505b425cc772.poster.avif?t=1769150515\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9761a9c2cb4c17f25d81505b425cc772.webm?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9761a9c2cb4c17f25d81505b425cc772.mp4?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may freely adjust your skills before battle, and choose how to empower yourself during non-combat moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/383ea68c8f4d204b98b3cc791e1dbd4f.poster.avif?t=1769150515\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/383ea68c8f4d204b98b3cc791e1dbd4f.webm?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/383ea68c8f4d204b98b3cc791e1dbd4f.mp4?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable protagonist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9eaeacb99502c21377adaa9347c2ea7d.poster.avif?t=1769150515\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9eaeacb99502c21377adaa9347c2ea7d.webm?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867250/extras/9eaeacb99502c21377adaa9347c2ea7d.mp4?t=1769150515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867250?t=1769150515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c